  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さてと……\r\n今日も元気に、アイドルを探しに行くか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "012"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001010090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "こんにちはーっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "009",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100900002/1009001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うおっ！\r\n……あっ、君は昨日の",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001010100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ、小宮果穂ですっ！\r\n……わぁっ、ここがお仕事する場所！スゴいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900002/1009001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普通の事務所だけどね\r\nところで、今日来てくれたってことは……",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001010110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ、そうでしたっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900002/1009001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001010120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、アイドルのことよく知らなかったから、\r\n帰ってからいろいろ調べてみたんです",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900002/1009001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001010130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうしたら、\r\nアイドルってみんなを笑顔にするらしいんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900002/1009001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001010140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "これって、あたしが好きなヒーローに似てるなー\r\nって思って！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900002/1009001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ヒーローか……うん、確かにアイドルも\r\nみんなを笑顔にするのは違いないぞ！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001010150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "やっぱり！　それで、お父さんとお母さんにも\r\nこの話をしたら、応援してくれたんです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900002/1009001010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001010160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だからあたし、アイドルやってみたいです！！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
